  "body": "i get a promble, when i use location.href = 'https://google.com', those fetch request had already been sended, but abort by webview or browser as js do location.href jump, how can we get the abort flag? in the fetch stardand doc [concept-response-aborted](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-response-aborted)\r\n> A response can have an associated aborted flag, which is initially unset.\r\n\r\nwhat is the aborted flag? how can developer get this flag? or [chrome fetch](https://developers.google.com/web/updates/2017/09/abortable-fetch) listed, use error.name === 'AbortError'?",
